  "problem": {
    "id": "train-601",
    "question": "A cheetah can run at a top speed of 60 mph.  The gazelle can run for speeds of up to 40 miles per hour.  If one mile per hour is about 1.5 feet per second, then how many seconds would it take for a cheetah traveling at top speed to catch up to a fleeing gazelle also running at top speed if the two animals were initially 210 feet apart and they both traveled in the same direction?",
    "gold": "7",
    "answer": "60 mph is 60*1.5=<<60*1.5=90>>90 feet per second.\n40 mph is 40*1.5=<<40*1.5=60>>60 feet per second.\nThus, for every second, the cheetah advances on the gazelle by 90-60=<<90-60=30>>30 feet per second.\nTo close on a distance of 200 feet, it would take the cheetah 210/30=7 seconds to catch the gazelle.\n#### 7"
  },
  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine how many seconds it would take for the cheetah to catch up to the gazelle, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. **Convert the speeds from miles per hour to feet per second:**\n   - The cheetah's speed is 60 mph. Since 1 mile per hour is approximately 1.5 feet per second, the cheetah's speed in feet per second is:\n     \\[\n     60 \\text{ mph} \\times 1.5 \\text{ feet/second per mph} = 90 \\text{ feet/second}\n     \\]\n   - The gazelle's speed is 40 mph. Similarly, the gazelle's speed in feet per second is:\n     \\[\n     40 \\text{ mph} \\times 1.5 \\text{ feet/second per mph} = 60 \\text{ feet/second}\n     \\]\n\n2. **Determine the relative speed of the cheetah with respect to the gazelle:**\n   - The relative speed is the difference between the cheetah's speed and the gazelle's speed:\n     \\[\n     90 \\text{ feet/second} - 60 \\text{ feet/second} = 30 \\text{ feet/second}\n     \\]\n\n3. **Calculate the time it takes for the cheetah to close the initial 210-foot gap:**\n   - The time \\( t \\) it takes to close the gap is the distance divided by the relative speed:\n     \\[\n     t = \\frac{210 \\text{ feet}}{30 \\text{ feet/second}} = 7 \\text{ seconds}\n     \\]\n\nTherefore, the time it takes for the cheetah to catch up to the gazelle is \\(\\boxed{7}\\) seconds.",
